---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Gallery from "../components/Gallery.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Josh Rehders — Concert and Sports Photographer & Videographer"
  description="Josh Rehders is a concert and sports photographer & videographer based in New York City."
>

  <main>  
    <Header />
    <div class="about-container">
      <div>
        <div>
          <p style="font-size: 25px;">Hey there, I'm Josh!</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p>I'm an alumnus&nbsp;of&nbsp;Vanderbilt University, where I worked as&nbsp;the Photography Director at The Vanderbilt Hustler, and freelanced&nbsp;around the Nashville area. I now work at Microsoft in New York City as a Software Developer, and have continued working in the photography space.&nbsp;</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p>I shoot everything from events to sports, music festivals to graduation photos, and just about anything in between. I've worked previously with student groups at Vanderbilt, artists local to Nashville as well as those visiting, various sports teams/outlets, and more to arrange coverage of events, create promotional photos, and cater to any photography-related needs.&nbsp;</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p>Over 500 of my photos have been used in published coverage, including <a href="https://apnews.com/article/covid-politics-health-soccer-sports-3ea64a2321a9ce1eabc8d757140c0988" target="_blank">by the Associated Press</a>, <a href="https://time.com/6975991/campus-protests-student-photojournalists-cover-story/" target="_blank">TIME Magazine</a>, <a href="https://pressfreedomtracker.us/all-incidents/tennessee-reporter-arrested-while-covering-student-protest-against-israel-gaza-war/" target="_blank">U.S. Press Freedom Tracker</a>,&nbsp;as well as on televised&nbsp;segments of <a href="https://www.msnbc.com/morning-joe/watch/how-vanderbilt-university-balances-free-speech-and-safety-209688133888" target="_blank">MSNBC's Morning Joe</a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<a href="https://www.goodmorningamerica.com/living/video/elite-athlete-opens-pressure-best-84052634" target="_blank">NBC's&nbsp;Good Morning America</a>.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p>If you're interested in coverage of a concert, festival, or event, live coverage of sports,&nbsp;or pursuing any other creative project, reach out to me via phone or email, and I'll get back to you quickly to discuss further!</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p>
            Email: <a href="mailto:josh@rehders.photos" target="_self">josh@rehders.photos</a>
            <br>
            Phone: <a href="tel:832-405-8765" target="_self">832-405-8765</a>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="client-list">
            Previous Sports Clients Include:
            <br>- Vanderbilt University Athletic Department
            <br>- University of Oregon Athletic Department
            <br>- Oregon State University Athletic Department
            <br>- On3 Sports
            <br><br>Previous Music Industry Clients Include:
            <br>- Full Circle Presents
            <br>- Yung Gravy
            <br>- ALEX || RAYNE MUSIC
            <br>- The Criticals
            <br>- Chateau Ste. Michelle Winery
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

</Layout>
